{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QYYAhJTJ2mLroBwAWZnoRo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'best 档下，所有核心假设经受住审稿检验。exp-014 的 naturalistic validation 提供生态效度证据，\n2\t  证明 K* 在真实 web 数据上有实际意义。exp-028 的 power analysis 回应样本量 concern， 证明 n=5K 的选择有充分 statistical\n3\t  justification。exp-026 integrated 的 honest negative 强化科学诚信叙事：K* 刻画的是 discriminability\n4\t  boundary 而非 data utility boundary， 这一 distinction 本身是 novel insight。审稿人将 honest\n5\t  reporting 视为加分项。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: 'exp-014: Naturalistic CC Validation'\n10\t  plan_id: exp-014\n11\t  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025-09 和 2026-01 两个 snapshot 各采样 5K 文档， 用训练好的 15D\n12\t    OBD classifier 做 depth prediction， 与 AlignScore (factual consistency) 和 type-token\n13\t    ratio (vocabulary richness) 做 correlation。 验证 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的生态效度。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    n_docs_per_snapshot: 5000\n18\t    total_docs: 10000\n19\t    depth_distribution_cc2025_09:\n20\t      depth_0: 0.645\n21\t      depth_1: 0.218\n22\t      depth_2: 0.094\n23\t      depth_3: 0.032\n24\t      depth_4_plus: 0.011\n25\t    depth_distribution_cc2026_01:\n26\t      depth_0: 0.598\n27\t      depth_1: 0.241\n28\t      depth_2: 0.112\n29\t      depth_3: 0.037\n30\t      depth_4_plus: 0.012\n31\t    synthetic_proportion_increase_2025_to_2026: +4.7pp\n32\t    correlation_depth_vs_alignscore:\n33\t      spearman_rho: -0.312\n34\t      p_value: <0.001\n35\t      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower factual consistency\n36\t    correlation_depth_vs_ttr:\n37\t      spearman_rho: -0.274\n38\t      p_value: <0.001\n39\t      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower vocabulary richness\n40\t    correlation_depth_vs_perplexity_ref:\n41\t      spearman_rho: -0.198\n42\t      p_value: <0.001\n43\t      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower reference perplexity (more predictable/generic)\n44\t    binary_0v1_precision_estimated: 0.82\n45\t    binary_0v1_recall_estimated: 0.78\n46\t    depth_2plus_collapse_rate: 0.73\n47\t    key_finding: 'Predicted depth 0 vs 1 separation is ecologically valid (correlates\n48\t      with independent quality proxies). Depth ≥2 predictions collapse (consistent\n49\t      with K*=2 one-wash boundary). 2026-01 shows higher synthetic proportion than\n50\t      2025-09, consistent with accelerating recursive contamination.\n51\t\n52\t      '\n53\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下，naturalistic validation 成功但不过度。 (1) depth 0 vs 1 的 correlation\n54\t    是 moderate (|ρ|~0.27-0.31) 而非 strong——这是合理的， 因为 AlignScore 和 TTR 只是 depth 的 noisy\n55\t    proxy，不是 ground truth depth。 审稿人不期望 wild data 上有 controlled experiment 级别的 correlation。\n56\t    (2) depth ≥2 预测的高 collapse rate (73%) 完美呼应 K*=2 的 one-wash laundering 故事： classifier\n57\t    无法在 depth 2+ 之间做有意义区分，正是因为 depth signal 在 K*=2 处饱和。 这不是 classifier 的失败，而是 K* boundary\n58\t    在 wild data 上的直接体现。 (3) 2025→2026 的 temporal trend (+4.7pp synthetic) 提供 policy\n59\t    relevance： 递归合成污染确实在加速。 (4) precision/recall 不需要很高（0.78-0.82 已足够），因为 this is not\n60\t    a detection paper—— 目标是验证 depth signal 的生态效度，不是提出一个 production detector。 审稿人在\n61\t    best 档下接受这些 moderate 数字为 \"consistent with controlled findings\" 而非 \"too weak\"。\n62\t\n63\t    '\n64\t  tables:\n65\t  - name: 'Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl Snapshots'\n66\t    content: '| Predicted Depth | CC 2025-09 | CC 2026-01 | Δ |\n67\t\n68\t      |----------------|-----------|-----------|-------|\n69\t\n70\t      | 0 (human) | 64.5% | 59.8% | -4.7pp |\n71\t\n72\t      | 1 | 21.8% | 24.1% | +2.3pp |\n73\t\n74\t      | 2 | 9.4% | 11.2% | +1.8pp |\n75\t\n76\t      | 3 | 3.2% | 3.7% | +0.5pp |\n77\t\n78\t      | 4+ | 1.1% | 1.2% | +0.1pp |\n79\t\n80\t      | Total synthetic (≥1) | 35.5% | 40.2% | +4.7pp |\n81\t\n82\t      '\n83\t  - name: 'Table: Correlation of Predicted Depth with Quality Proxies'\n84\t    content: '| Quality Metric | Spearman ρ | 95% CI | p-value |\n85\t\n86\t      |---------------|-----------|---------|---------|\n87\t\n88\t      | AlignScore | -0.312 | [-0.341, -0.282] | <0.001 |\n89\t\n90\t      | Type-Token Ratio | -0.274 | [-0.304, -0.244] | <0.001 |\n91\t\n92\t      | Reference Perplexity | -0.198 | [-0.229, -0.167] | <0.001 |\n93\t\n94\t      '\n95\t  figures_description:\n96\t  - 'Fig: Stacked bar chart of predicted depth distribution, CC 2025-09 vs 2026-01.\n97\t    Visual emphasis on depth 0→1 transition dominating the synthetic fraction.'\n98\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot (predicted depth vs AlignScore) with marginal density. Shows\n99\t    clear separation between depth 0 and 1, but depth 2-4 cluster together — visualizing\n100\t    the K*=2 saturation boundary in wild data.'\n101\t  - 'Fig: Quality degradation curve — mean AlignScore and TTR by predicted depth.\n102\t    Sharp drop from depth 0 to 1, plateau from depth 2 onward. Annotate K*=2 saturation\n103\t    line.'\n104\t  analysis: 'naturalistic validation 完成两个目标：(1) depth signal 在 controlled 和 wild setting\n105\t    间 transfer， moderate correlation 充分（审稿人对 wild data 的期望本就低于 controlled）； (2) depth\n106\t    ≥2 的 collapse 是 K*=2 one-wash laundering 的直接推论， 从 limitation 转化为 confirming evidence。temporal\n107\t    trend 增加 policy impact framing。 Limitation 段落诚实报告：无 ground truth depth annotation\n108\t    for CC data， correlation 是 indirect evidence。best 档下审稿人接受此为 \"compelling supporting\n109\t    analysis\"。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t- name: 'exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve'\n113\t  plan_id: exp-028\n114\t  description: '从 exp-001 (Pythia C4) 和 exp-017 (Qwen-cont C4) 的 30K 样本池中， 以 n∈{500,\n115\t    1000, 1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 4000, 5000} 做 10 次随机重采样， 每次计算 1v2 AUC 及 bootstrap\n116\t    CI，记录 K*=2 判定成功率（CI lower > θ=0.60）。 绘制 power curve，确定 80% 和 95% power 的最低样本量。\n117\t\n118\t    '\n119\t  expected_results:\n120\t    models_tested:\n121\t    - Pythia-1.4B (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6539, strong signal)\n122\t    - Qwen-cont (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6112, marginal signal)\n123\t    resamples_per_n: 10\n124\t    power_pythia:\n125\t      n_500: 0.3\n126\t      n_1000: 0.6\n127\t      n_1500: 0.8\n128\t      n_2000: 0.9\n129\t      n_2500: 1.0\n130\t      n_3000: 1.0\n131\t      n_4000: 1.0\n132\t      n_5000: 1.0\n133\t    power_qwen_cont:\n134\t      n_500: 0.1\n135\t      n_1000: 0.3\n136\t      n_1500: 0.4\n137\t      n_2000: 0.6\n138\t      n_2500: 0.7\n139\t      n_3000: 0.8\n140\t      n_4000: 0.9\n141\t      n_5000: 1.0\n142\t    ci_halfwidth_by_n:\n143\t      n_500: 0.023\n144\t      n_1000: 0.016\n145\t      n_1500: 0.013\n146\t      n_2000: 0.011\n147\t      n_2500: 0.01\n148\t      n_3000: 0.009\n149\t      n_4000: 0.008\n150\t      n_5000: 0.007\n151\t    critical_n_80pct_power:\n152\t      pythia: 1500\n153\t      qwen_cont: 3000\n154\t    critical_n_95pct_power:\n155\t      pythia: 2000\n156\t      qwen_cont: 4500\n157\t    k_star_stability:\n158\t      all_n_geq_2000_pythia_kstar_2: true\n159\t      all_n_geq_4000_qwen_cont_kstar_2: true\n160\t    key_finding: 'Pythia (strong signal) achieves 80% power at n=1500, 95% at n=2000.\n161\t      Qwen-cont (marginal signal) needs n=3000 for 80%, n=4500 for 95%. Our n=5000\n162\t      design provides >95% power for all models including the most marginal. CI half-width\n163\t      at n=5000 is ~0.007, sufficient to resolve AUC differences of 0.015+.\n164\t\n165\t      '\n166\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下 power analysis 回应两个 reviewer concern： (1) \"样本量够吗？\" →\n167\t    n=5000 对最强 signal (Pythia) 过饱和，对最弱 signal (Qwen-cont) 刚好充分。 这解释了为什么 Qwen-cont\n168\t    的 CI lower=0.6015 如此边缘——它确实是 power-limited 的 marginal case， 但整体 7/8 的 evidence\n169\t    chain 不依赖这一个 configuration。 (2) \"最低需要多少样本？\" → n≥2000 对 moderate-to-strong signal\n170\t    已足够， 这为 practitioner deployment 提供 actionable guidance。 CI half-width 的 1/√n 缩放与理论预期一致。\n171\t    审稿人看到 power curve 后会认为实验设计是 well-powered 的， Qwen-cont 的边缘性是 signal weakness（text-intrinsic）而非\n172\t    design flaw。 这与 \"marginal case 不削弱整体结论\" 的核心辩护策略一致。\n173\t\n174\t    '\n175\t  tables:\n176\t  - name: 'Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size'\n177\t    content: '| n | Pythia (AUC≈0.654) | Qwen-cont (AUC≈0.611) | CI half-width |\n178\t\n179\t      |------|-------------------|----------------------|--------------|\n180\t\n181\t      | 500 | 3/10 (30%) | 1/10 (10%) | ±0.023 |\n182\t\n183\t      | 1000 | 6/10 (60%) | 3/10 (30%) | ±0.016 |\n184\t\n185\t      | 1500 | 8/10 (80%) | 4/10 (40%) | ±0.013 |\n186\t\n187\t      | 2000 | 9/10 (90%) | 6/10 (60%) | ±0.011 |\n188\t\n189\t      | 2500 | 10/10 (100%) | 7/10 (70%) | ±0.010 |\n190\t\n191\t      | 3000 | 10/10 (100%) | 8/10 (80%) | ±0.009 |\n192\t\n193\t      | 4000 | 10/10 (100%) | 9/10 (90%) | ±0.008 |\n194\t\n195\t      | 5000 | 10/10 (100%) | 10/10 (100%) | ±0.007 |\n196\t\n197\t      '\n198\t  - name: 'Table: Critical Sample Sizes for K*=2 Determination'\n199\t    content: '| Power Level | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen-cont | OLMo-1B (interpolated) |\n200\t\n201\t      |------------|------------|-----------|----------------------|\n202\t\n203\t      | 80% | ~1,500 | ~3,000 | ~2,000 |\n204\t\n205\t      | 95% | ~2,000 | ~4,500 | ~2,800 |\n206\t\n207\t      | 99% | ~3,000 | ~5,000+ | ~3,500 |\n208\t\n209\t      '\n210\t  figures_description:\n211\t  - 'Fig: Power curve — x-axis: sample size n, y-axis: fraction of resamples yielding\n212\t    K*=2. Two curves (Pythia solid, Qwen-cont dashed). Horizontal reference lines\n213\t    at 80% and 95%. Vertical drop-lines at critical n values. Shows our n=5000 is\n214\t    well above both 95% thresholds.'\n215\t  - 'Fig: CI half-width convergence — log-log plot of CI half-width vs n, with 1/√n\n216\t    reference line. Demonstrates that empirical convergence matches theoretical rate.'\n217\t  analysis: 'power analysis 将 Qwen-cont 的边缘性从 weakness 转化为 understood and quantified\n218\t    phenomenon： AUC=0.611 距 θ=0.60 仅 0.011，需要 n≥3000 才能 robustly resolve。 我们的 n=5000\n219\t    设计 provides adequate power，但 marginal signal 的存在本身 反映了 continuation mode 下 depth\n220\t    signal 确实更弱（vs rewrite 的 0.696）。 Power curve 同时为 practitioner 提供 deployment guidance：\n221\t    如果只需要 binary detection (0v1)，n=500 即绰绰有余（AUC>0.92 everywhere）； depth discrimination\n222\t    的 power requirement 与 K* boundary 处的 signal strength 成正比。\n223\t\n224\t    '\n225\t- name: exp-026 arXiv Filtering Negative Result Integration\n226\t  plan_id: exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\n227\t  description: '将 exp-025 (Pythia filtering null) 和 exp-026 (arXiv graduated filtering\n228\t    null) 的负向结果 整合进论文 Section 5 和 Discussion。不产生新实验数据，但重新框架化已有结果， 引出 \"K* characterizes\n229\t    discriminability, not data utility\" 的核心洞察。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  expected_results:\n233\t    exp025_summary:\n234\t      pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '+0.0017'\n235\t      pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0000'\n236\t      pythia_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '-0.0007'\n237\t      conclusion: all deltas within noise (max 0.17pp)\n238\t    exp026_summary:\n239\t      arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '+0.0001'\n240\t      arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '-0.0001'\n241\t      arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '-0.0023'\n242\t      arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0042'\n243\t      conclusion: graduated ≈ no_filter; binary shows metric-specific trade-off\n244\t    paper_framing:\n245\t      section_5_addition: 'Table 5: arXiv Domain Filtering Results (K*=3)'\n246\t      discussion_insight: 'K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary\n247\t        of recursive generation depth, not the downstream utility boundary. Depth\n248\t        2 and 3 arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (2v3 AUC=0.64) but not\n249\t        necessarily detrimental to training (graduated ≈ no_filter). This distinction\n250\t        is practically important: K* tells curators WHERE detection can differentiate\n251\t        depths, but not WHETHER differentiation improves outcomes.\n252\t\n253\t        '\n254\t      honest_negative_framing: 'We hypothesized that arXiv K*=3 would enable graduated\n255\t        filtering to outperform binary. This hypothesis was not confirmed. The null\n256\t        result reveals a fundamental distinction: K* measures discriminability, not\n257\t        utility.\n258\t\n259\t        '\n260\t    reviewer_reception_prediction:\n261\t      credibility_boost: +0.3 to +0.5 ARR points on soundness/presentation\n262\t      trivial_concern_reduction: honest reporting of disconfirmed hypothesis reduces\n263\t        suspicion of cherry-picking\n264\t      insight_value: K* ≠ utility distinction is a genuine conceptual contribution\n265\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下，honest negative 是科学诚信的 strong signal： (1) 审稿人在 2024-2026\n266\t    的 ML 生态中对 cherry-picking 高度警觉。 一篇主动报告 disconfirmed hypothesis 的论文立即与 \"只报好结果\" 的\n267\t    median submission 区分开。 (2) K* ≠ utility 的洞察不是空洞的\"future work\"——它有具体的 empirical\n268\t    grounding： arXiv 2v3 AUC=0.64 证明 depth 2-3 确实 statistically distinguishable， 但\n269\t    downstream eval 显示 graduated filtering 无增量价值。 这意味着 depth 2-3 arXiv 文本虽然在 feature\n270\t    space 上可分， 但其质量差异不足以影响 LM training dynamics。 这一 gap 在 DPI framework 下是 coherent\n271\t    的： DPI 保证的是 information loss（features 可以检测到），但 information loss 未必 map 到 training\n272\t    utility loss。 (3) exp-025 Pythia null 进一步强化：即使在 C4 K*=2 上， Pythia 这种较弱模型的 filtering\n273\t    收益也在 noise level。 结合 exp-006 Qwen C4 上 binary 的显著优势， 论文的叙事变为 \"filtering 收益取决于\n274\t    base model capacity × domain × contamination level 的交互\"， 而非 universal claim。这种\n275\t    nuanced framing 在 best 档下被审稿人视为 scientific maturity。\n276\t\n277\t    '\n278\t  tables:\n279\t  - name: 'Table 5 (paper): arXiv Domain Filtering (K*=3) — Negative Result'\n280\t    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter | Δ HS vs no-filter\n281\t      |\n282\t\n283\t      |----------|------|-----------|-------------------|-------------------|\n284\t\n285\t      | No filter | 0.5899±0.0008 | 0.6600±0.0002 | — | — |\n286\t\n287\t      | Binary | 0.5876±0.0004 | 0.6642±0.0004 | -0.23pp (p=0.005) | +0.42pp (p<0.001)\n288\t      |\n289\t\n290\t      | Graduated (α=0.9) | 0.5900±0.0011 | 0.6599±0.0003 | +0.01pp (p=0.89) | -0.01pp\n291\t      (p=0.71) |\n292\t\n293\t      '\n294\t  - name: 'Discussion Table: K* vs Utility Summary'\n295\t    content: '| Domain | K* | Graduated > Binary? | Interpretation |\n296\t\n297\t      |--------|-----|-------------------|----------------|\n298\t\n299\t      | C4 (Qwen) | 2 | No (binary best) | K*=2 → binary sufficient, graduated adds\n300\t      noise |\n301\t\n302\t      | C4 (Pythia) | 2 | No (all ≈ equal) | Weaker model → filtering benefit below\n303\t      detection |\n304\t\n305\t      | arXiv (Qwen) | 3 | No (graduated ≈ no-filter) | K*=3 discriminability ≠ training\n306\t      utility |\n307\t\n308\t      '\n309\t  figures_description:\n310\t  - 'Fig (Discussion): Conceptual diagram — two-axis plot with ''Statistical Discriminability\n311\t    (K*)'' on x-axis and ''Downstream Utility Gain from Depth-Aware Filtering'' on\n312\t    y-axis. Three domain points plotted: Wikipedia (K*=1, minimal gain), C4 (K*=2,\n313\t    moderate gain with binary), arXiv (K*=3, no gain from graduated). The non-monotonic\n314\t    relationship between K* and utility is the key visual message.'\n315\t  analysis: integration 的核心价值不在新数据，而在 reframing。 exp-025/exp-026 的 null results 在\n316\t    naive framing 下削弱 C3 (\"K*-aware filtering works\")。 但在 best 档的 sophisticated framing\n317\t    下，它们： (1) 区分了 K* 的 diagnostic 功能（测量 discriminability boundary）与 prescriptive 功能（指导\n318\t    curation）， (2) 为 C3 claim 增加 nuance：binary filtering 在 K*=2 web text 上有效是 C3 的\n319\t    validated core， graduated 在 K*=3 上无效是 honest boundary condition， (3) 引出 \"K* ≠\n320\t    utility\" 作为 Discussion 的独立贡献点， potentially 激发 follow-up 研究（何时 depth discriminability\n321\t    DOES translate to utility？）。 审稿人在 best 档下认为这种自我修正式叙事 \"refreshing\" 且 \"scientifically\n322\t    mature\"。\n323\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"071b45fe-4395-4ce7-ae78-10a1f0868ef1","uuid":"04120b19-2ad2-43c6-ac39-6a842a450253","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:56:33.112Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T123349/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'best 档下，所有核心假设经受住审稿检验。exp-014 的 naturalistic validation 提供生态效度证据，\n  证明 K* 在真实 web 数据上有实际意义。exp-028 的 power analysis 回应样本量 concern， 证明 n=5K 的选择有充分 statistical\n  justification。exp-026 integrated 的 honest negative 强化科学诚信叙事：K* 刻画的是 discriminability\n  boundary 而非 data utility boundary， 这一 distinction 本身是 novel insight。审稿人将 honest\n  reporting 视为加分项。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'exp-014: Naturalistic CC Validation'\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025-09 和 2026-01 两个 snapshot 各采样 5K 文档， 用训练好的 15D\n    OBD classifier 做 depth prediction， 与 AlignScore (factual consistency) 和 type-token\n    ratio (vocabulary richness) 做 correlation。 验证 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的生态效度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_docs_per_snapshot: 5000\n    total_docs: 10000\n    depth_distribution_cc2025_09:\n      depth_0: 0.645\n      depth_1: 0.218\n      depth_2: 0.094\n      depth_3: 0.032\n      depth_4_plus: 0.011\n    depth_distribution_cc2026_01:\n      depth_0: 0.598\n      depth_1: 0.241\n      depth_2: 0.112\n      depth_3: 0.037\n      depth_4_plus: 0.012\n    synthetic_proportion_increase_2025_to_2026: +4.7pp\n    correlation_depth_vs_alignscore:\n      spearman_rho: -0.312\n      p_value: <0.001\n      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower factual consistency\n    correlation_depth_vs_ttr:\n      spearman_rho: -0.274\n      p_value: <0.001\n      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower vocabulary richness\n    correlation_depth_vs_perplexity_ref:\n      spearman_rho: -0.198\n      p_value: <0.001\n      direction: deeper predicted depth → lower reference perplexity (more predictable/generic)\n    binary_0v1_precision_estimated: 0.82\n    binary_0v1_recall_estimated: 0.78\n    depth_2plus_collapse_rate: 0.73\n    key_finding: 'Predicted depth 0 vs 1 separation is ecologically valid (correlates\n      with independent quality proxies). Depth ≥2 predictions collapse (consistent\n      with K*=2 one-wash boundary). 2026-01 shows higher synthetic proportion than\n      2025-09, consistent with accelerating recursive contamination.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下，naturalistic validation 成功但不过度。 (1) depth 0 vs 1 的 correlation\n    是 moderate (|ρ|~0.27-0.31) 而非 strong——这是合理的， 因为 AlignScore 和 TTR 只是 depth 的 noisy\n    proxy，不是 ground truth depth。 审稿人不期望 wild data 上有 controlled experiment 级别的 correlation。\n    (2) depth ≥2 预测的高 collapse rate (73%) 完美呼应 K*=2 的 one-wash laundering 故事： classifier\n    无法在 depth 2+ 之间做有意义区分，正是因为 depth signal 在 K*=2 处饱和。 这不是 classifier 的失败，而是 K* boundary\n    在 wild data 上的直接体现。 (3) 2025→2026 的 temporal trend (+4.7pp synthetic) 提供 policy\n    relevance： 递归合成污染确实在加速。 (4) precision/recall 不需要很高（0.78-0.82 已足够），因为 this is not\n    a detection paper—— 目标是验证 depth signal 的生态效度，不是提出一个 production detector。 审稿人在\n    best 档下接受这些 moderate 数字为 \"consistent with controlled findings\" 而非 \"too weak\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl Snapshots'\n    content: '| Predicted Depth | CC 2025-09 | CC 2026-01 | Δ |\n\n      |----------------|-----------|-----------|-------|\n\n      | 0 (human) | 64.5% | 59.8% | -4.7pp |\n\n      | 1 | 21.8% | 24.1% | +2.3pp |\n\n      | 2 | 9.4% | 11.2% | +1.8pp |\n\n      | 3 | 3.2% | 3.7% | +0.5pp |\n\n      | 4+ | 1.1% | 1.2% | +0.1pp |\n\n      | Total synthetic (≥1) | 35.5% | 40.2% | +4.7pp |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Correlation of Predicted Depth with Quality Proxies'\n    content: '| Quality Metric | Spearman ρ | 95% CI | p-value |\n\n      |---------------|-----------|---------|---------|\n\n      | AlignScore | -0.312 | [-0.341, -0.282] | <0.001 |\n\n      | Type-Token Ratio | -0.274 | [-0.304, -0.244] | <0.001 |\n\n      | Reference Perplexity | -0.198 | [-0.229, -0.167] | <0.001 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Stacked bar chart of predicted depth distribution, CC 2025-09 vs 2026-01.\n    Visual emphasis on depth 0→1 transition dominating the synthetic fraction.'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot (predicted depth vs AlignScore) with marginal density. Shows\n    clear separation between depth 0 and 1, but depth 2-4 cluster together — visualizing\n    the K*=2 saturation boundary in wild data.'\n  - 'Fig: Quality degradation curve — mean AlignScore and TTR by predicted depth.\n    Sharp drop from depth 0 to 1, plateau from depth 2 onward. Annotate K*=2 saturation\n    line.'\n  analysis: 'naturalistic validation 完成两个目标：(1) depth signal 在 controlled 和 wild setting\n    间 transfer， moderate correlation 充分（审稿人对 wild data 的期望本就低于 controlled）； (2) depth\n    ≥2 的 collapse 是 K*=2 one-wash laundering 的直接推论， 从 limitation 转化为 confirming evidence。temporal\n    trend 增加 policy impact framing。 Limitation 段落诚实报告：无 ground truth depth annotation\n    for CC data， correlation 是 indirect evidence。best 档下审稿人接受此为 \"compelling supporting\n    analysis\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve'\n  plan_id: exp-028\n  description: '从 exp-001 (Pythia C4) 和 exp-017 (Qwen-cont C4) 的 30K 样本池中， 以 n∈{500,\n    1000, 1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 4000, 5000} 做 10 次随机重采样， 每次计算 1v2 AUC 及 bootstrap\n    CI，记录 K*=2 判定成功率（CI lower > θ=0.60）。 绘制 power curve，确定 80% 和 95% power 的最低样本量。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    models_tested:\n    - Pythia-1.4B (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6539, strong signal)\n    - Qwen-cont (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6112, marginal signal)\n    resamples_per_n: 10\n    power_pythia:\n      n_500: 0.3\n      n_1000: 0.6\n      n_1500: 0.8\n      n_2000: 0.9\n      n_2500: 1.0\n      n_3000: 1.0\n      n_4000: 1.0\n      n_5000: 1.0\n    power_qwen_cont:\n      n_500: 0.1\n      n_1000: 0.3\n      n_1500: 0.4\n      n_2000: 0.6\n      n_2500: 0.7\n      n_3000: 0.8\n      n_4000: 0.9\n      n_5000: 1.0\n    ci_halfwidth_by_n:\n      n_500: 0.023\n      n_1000: 0.016\n      n_1500: 0.013\n      n_2000: 0.011\n      n_2500: 0.01\n      n_3000: 0.009\n      n_4000: 0.008\n      n_5000: 0.007\n    critical_n_80pct_power:\n      pythia: 1500\n      qwen_cont: 3000\n    critical_n_95pct_power:\n      pythia: 2000\n      qwen_cont: 4500\n    k_star_stability:\n      all_n_geq_2000_pythia_kstar_2: true\n      all_n_geq_4000_qwen_cont_kstar_2: true\n    key_finding: 'Pythia (strong signal) achieves 80% power at n=1500, 95% at n=2000.\n      Qwen-cont (marginal signal) needs n=3000 for 80%, n=4500 for 95%. Our n=5000\n      design provides >95% power for all models including the most marginal. CI half-width\n      at n=5000 is ~0.007, sufficient to resolve AUC differences of 0.015+.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下 power analysis 回应两个 reviewer concern： (1) \"样本量够吗？\" →\n    n=5000 对最强 signal (Pythia) 过饱和，对最弱 signal (Qwen-cont) 刚好充分。 这解释了为什么 Qwen-cont\n    的 CI lower=0.6015 如此边缘——它确实是 power-limited 的 marginal case， 但整体 7/8 的 evidence\n    chain 不依赖这一个 configuration。 (2) \"最低需要多少样本？\" → n≥2000 对 moderate-to-strong signal\n    已足够， 这为 practitioner deployment 提供 actionable guidance。 CI half-width 的 1/√n 缩放与理论预期一致。\n    审稿人看到 power curve 后会认为实验设计是 well-powered 的， Qwen-cont 的边缘性是 signal weakness（text-intrinsic）而非\n    design flaw。 这与 \"marginal case 不削弱整体结论\" 的核心辩护策略一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size'\n    content: '| n | Pythia (AUC≈0.654) | Qwen-cont (AUC≈0.611) | CI half-width |\n\n      |------|-------------------|----------------------|--------------|\n\n      | 500 | 3/10 (30%) | 1/10 (10%) | ±0.023 |\n\n      | 1000 | 6/10 (60%) | 3/10 (30%) | ±0.016 |\n\n      | 1500 | 8/10 (80%) | 4/10 (40%) | ±0.013 |\n\n      | 2000 | 9/10 (90%) | 6/10 (60%) | ±0.011 |\n\n      | 2500 | 10/10 (100%) | 7/10 (70%) | ±0.010 |\n\n      | 3000 | 10/10 (100%) | 8/10 (80%) | ±0.009 |\n\n      | 4000 | 10/10 (100%) | 9/10 (90%) | ±0.008 |\n\n      | 5000 | 10/10 (100%) | 10/10 (100%) | ±0.007 |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Critical Sample Sizes for K*=2 Determination'\n    content: '| Power Level | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen-cont | OLMo-1B (interpolated) |\n\n      |------------|------------|-----------|----------------------|\n\n      | 80% | ~1,500 | ~3,000 | ~2,000 |\n\n      | 95% | ~2,000 | ~4,500 | ~2,800 |\n\n      | 99% | ~3,000 | ~5,000+ | ~3,500 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power curve — x-axis: sample size n, y-axis: fraction of resamples yielding\n    K*=2. Two curves (Pythia solid, Qwen-cont dashed). Horizontal reference lines\n    at 80% and 95%. Vertical drop-lines at critical n values. Shows our n=5000 is\n    well above both 95% thresholds.'\n  - 'Fig: CI half-width convergence — log-log plot of CI half-width vs n, with 1/√n\n    reference line. Demonstrates that empirical convergence matches theoretical rate.'\n  analysis: 'power analysis 将 Qwen-cont 的边缘性从 weakness 转化为 understood and quantified\n    phenomenon： AUC=0.611 距 θ=0.60 仅 0.011，需要 n≥3000 才能 robustly resolve。 我们的 n=5000\n    设计 provides adequate power，但 marginal signal 的存在本身 反映了 continuation mode 下 depth\n    signal 确实更弱（vs rewrite 的 0.696）。 Power curve 同时为 practitioner 提供 deployment guidance：\n    如果只需要 binary detection (0v1)，n=500 即绰绰有余（AUC>0.92 everywhere）； depth discrimination\n    的 power requirement 与 K* boundary 处的 signal strength 成正比。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-026 arXiv Filtering Negative Result Integration\n  plan_id: exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\n  description: '将 exp-025 (Pythia filtering null) 和 exp-026 (arXiv graduated filtering\n    null) 的负向结果 整合进论文 Section 5 和 Discussion。不产生新实验数据，但重新框架化已有结果， 引出 \"K* characterizes\n    discriminability, not data utility\" 的核心洞察。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    exp025_summary:\n      pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '+0.0017'\n      pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0000'\n      pythia_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '-0.0007'\n      conclusion: all deltas within noise (max 0.17pp)\n    exp026_summary:\n      arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '+0.0001'\n      arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '-0.0001'\n      arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta: '-0.0023'\n      arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0042'\n      conclusion: graduated ≈ no_filter; binary shows metric-specific trade-off\n    paper_framing:\n      section_5_addition: 'Table 5: arXiv Domain Filtering Results (K*=3)'\n      discussion_insight: 'K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary\n        of recursive generation depth, not the downstream utility boundary. Depth\n        2 and 3 arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (2v3 AUC=0.64) but not\n        necessarily detrimental to training (graduated ≈ no_filter). This distinction\n        is practically important: K* tells curators WHERE detection can differentiate\n        depths, but not WHETHER differentiation improves outcomes.\n\n        '\n      honest_negative_framing: 'We hypothesized that arXiv K*=3 would enable graduated\n        filtering to outperform binary. This hypothesis was not confirmed. The null\n        result reveals a fundamental distinction: K* measures discriminability, not\n        utility.\n\n        '\n    reviewer_reception_prediction:\n      credibility_boost: +0.3 to +0.5 ARR points on soundness/presentation\n      trivial_concern_reduction: honest reporting of disconfirmed hypothesis reduces\n        suspicion of cherry-picking\n      insight_value: K* ≠ utility distinction is a genuine conceptual contribution\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下，honest negative 是科学诚信的 strong signal： (1) 审稿人在 2024-2026\n    的 ML 生态中对 cherry-picking 高度警觉。 一篇主动报告 disconfirmed hypothesis 的论文立即与 \"只报好结果\" 的\n    median submission 区分开。 (2) K* ≠ utility 的洞察不是空洞的\"future work\"——它有具体的 empirical\n    grounding： arXiv 2v3 AUC=0.64 证明 depth 2-3 确实 statistically distinguishable， 但\n    downstream eval 显示 graduated filtering 无增量价值。 这意味着 depth 2-3 arXiv 文本虽然在 feature\n    space 上可分， 但其质量差异不足以影响 LM training dynamics。 这一 gap 在 DPI framework 下是 coherent\n    的： DPI 保证的是 information loss（features 可以检测到），但 information loss 未必 map 到 training\n    utility loss。 (3) exp-025 Pythia null 进一步强化：即使在 C4 K*=2 上， Pythia 这种较弱模型的 filtering\n    收益也在 noise level。 结合 exp-006 Qwen C4 上 binary 的显著优势， 论文的叙事变为 \"filtering 收益取决于\n    base model capacity × domain × contamination level 的交互\"， 而非 universal claim。这种\n    nuanced framing 在 best 档下被审稿人视为 scientific maturity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5 (paper): arXiv Domain Filtering (K*=3) — Negative Result'\n    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter | Δ HS vs no-filter\n      |\n\n      |----------|------|-----------|-------------------|-------------------|\n\n      | No filter | 0.5899±0.0008 | 0.6600±0.0002 | — | — |\n\n      | Binary | 0.5876±0.0004 | 0.6642±0.0004 | -0.23pp (p=0.005) | +0.42pp (p<0.001)\n      |\n\n      | Graduated (α=0.9) | 0.5900±0.0011 | 0.6599±0.0003 | +0.01pp (p=0.89) | -0.01pp\n      (p=0.71) |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Discussion Table: K* vs Utility Summary'\n    content: '| Domain | K* | Graduated > Binary? | Interpretation |\n\n      |--------|-----|-------------------|----------------|\n\n      | C4 (Qwen) | 2 | No (binary best) | K*=2 → binary sufficient, graduated adds\n      noise |\n\n      | C4 (Pythia) | 2 | No (all ≈ equal) | Weaker model → filtering benefit below\n      detection |\n\n      | arXiv (Qwen) | 3 | No (graduated ≈ no-filter) | K*=3 discriminability ≠ training\n      utility |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig (Discussion): Conceptual diagram — two-axis plot with ''Statistical Discriminability\n    (K*)'' on x-axis and ''Downstream Utility Gain from Depth-Aware Filtering'' on\n    y-axis. Three domain points plotted: Wikipedia (K*=1, minimal gain), C4 (K*=2,\n    moderate gain with binary), arXiv (K*=3, no gain from graduated). The non-monotonic\n    relationship between K* and utility is the key visual message.'\n  analysis: integration 的核心价值不在新数据，而在 reframing。 exp-025/exp-026 的 null results 在\n    naive framing 下削弱 C3 (\"K*-aware filtering works\")。 但在 best 档的 sophisticated framing\n    下，它们： (1) 区分了 K* 的 diagnostic 功能（测量 discriminability boundary）与 prescriptive 功能（指导\n    curation）， (2) 为 C3 claim 增加 nuance：binary filtering 在 K*=2 web text 上有效是 C3 的\n    validated core， graduated 在 K*=3 上无效是 honest boundary condition， (3) 引出 \"K* ≠\n    utility\" 作为 Discussion 的独立贡献点， potentially 激发 follow-up 研究（何时 depth discriminability\n    DOES translate to utility？）。 审稿人在 best 档下认为这种自我修正式叙事 \"refreshing\" 且 \"scientifically\n    mature\"。\n","numLines":323,"startLine":1,"totalLines":323}}}
